# Local values for `wrangler dev`. Copy to `.dev.vars` (ignored by git) and fill
# in. These are the page credential of ADR 0006 and the cookie secret of ADR
# 0007; the deployed values are GitHub repository secrets and never appear in
# this repository. The cookie secret is any long random string.
PAGE_USERNAME=reader
PAGE_PASSWORD=change-me
PAGE_COOKIE_SECRET=change-me-too
